  "summary": "For as long as I can remember my favorite question is \"Why?\". Why does the television turn on when you press the button? So I took the remote control apart to get to the bottom of it. I have always loved to know why things work the way they do. I think times like those moments is when I discovered that I have a passion for technology and a string desire to know how things work. I have always been a problem-solver and enjoy a good challenge and my love for solving puzzles.\n\nI previously worked at a Whole Foods Market, where although I didn't learn any technical skills to help me in my development role, I did develop a lot of the soft skills that I think are key to this industry. During my time there I learned organizational skills, communication skills and a plethora of other skills that were key to me being able to run the #1 team in the entire Mid-Atlantic region. I pride myself on being a positive reinforcement on any team that I am in, being approachable, and always being dependable.\n\nI took a chance and left that behind in pursuit of a field that to me is more challenging and engaging, I look to bring those skills that I have learned over the years to whichever team that I am working on.",
